  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nOnce per wave, a recorded
    hero injury permanently removes 2 maximum HP for that battle and then attempts
    a full heal. Royal health cannot be refilled; hero healing restrictions still
    apply. Shared across copies.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nChampion / Healing correction:
    +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three
    units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA theatre refugee
    whose mask preserved a role after the troupe disbanded. The role taught courage
    but sometimes speaks over their wishes. They are learning to remove it without
    apologising for the quieter voice beneath.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nOwn weapon damage
    gains 0.5% per companion body in the roster, before later balance modifiers.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: oddity, resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
